---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
import Breadcrumb from '../components/astro/Breadcrumb.astro';
---
<SiteLayout title="Privacy Notice | Gibraltar For Sale" description="Privacy information for the public Gibraltar For Sale content website. No first-party forms, account or alert feature is currently active.">
  <Breadcrumb items={[{ label: 'Privacy' }]} />
  <article class="mx-auto max-w-[1000px] px-5 pb-20 pt-10 sm:px-8 lg:px-12 lg:pb-28 lg:pt-16">
    <p class="text-xs font-extrabold uppercase tracking-[.18em] text-sea-700">Privacy notice</p>
    <h1 class="mt-3 font-display text-5xl font-semibold leading-tight text-ink-900 sm:text-6xl">How this site handles information</h1>
    <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-stone-600">Last reviewed 10 November 2026</p>
    <div class="article-content mt-8">
      <p>This website currently publishes information pages. It has no first-party contact or waitlist form, account, saved-search feature or property-alert subscription. Do not send personal information through a page that does not provide a working, clearly described submission service.</p>
      <h2 id="operator">Website operator</h2>
      <p>The legal name and contact details of the website operator have not yet been provided for publication. This is an incomplete launch item; verified operator details and a privacy contact should be supplied before any personal-data collection or enquiry service begins.</p>
      <h2 id="hosting">Hosting and technical information</h2>
      <p>The pages are hosted on Netlify. The hosting provider may process technical request information such as IP address, browser or device details, referring page and request time for delivery, security and service operation. The site owner should verify the applicable Netlify settings and retention terms. The website itself does not provide access to, or an independent record of, host security logs.</p>
      <h2 id="analytics">Analytics and external resources</h2>
      <p>No Google Analytics, Meta Pixel, session-replay or advertising script is intentionally added in the website source. The repository alone cannot confirm whether an optional Netlify Analytics product or other account-level measurement is enabled in the hosting dashboard. That setting and any associated disclosures must be checked by the site operator before making a categorical claim.</p>
      <p>Some pages link to external official sources, Wikimedia Commons and Unsplash. Following an external link takes you to that provider, which has its own privacy and cookie practices. The website also loads its typography from locally bundled files rather than a remote font service.</p>
      <h2 id="rights">Questions and privacy requests</h2>
      <p>Because verified operator contact details have not been supplied, there is not yet a reliable privacy-request address to publish. The owner should add a monitored contact address and identify the responsible controller before enabling forms, accounts, marketing email or analytics that require a notice.</p>
      <h2 id="changes">Changes</h2>
      <p>This notice describes the current information-only site and will need revision if its functionality, hosting configuration, analytics or data-processing arrangements change.</p>
    </div>
  </article>
</SiteLayout>
